$ORIGIN com.
$TTL 3600
@   IN SOA a.gtld-servers.net. hostmaster.gtld-servers.net. 2026101001 1800 900 604800 300
    IN NS  a.gtld-servers.net.

; example.com is delegated with in-bailiwick glue
example      IN NS ns1.example.com.
ns1.example   IN A  198.51.100.10

; glueless.com is delegated to a nameserver under .net (no glue available)
glueless     IN NS ns.dnshost.net.

; unsigned and signed delegations are exercised in the DNSSEC tests
